ude80 The World's First XR fitness application with real load experience! \n# \nMeet **Jump Rope XR** \u2013 a **XR fitness app** where you jump with a **virtual jump rope** and get the **same real workout effect** as with a physical one! \n# \n\ud83d\udca1 **Virtual Jump Rope - No limits for training**  \nNo need for a large space \u2013 **train anywhere**, and **your results will be just as effective** as with a real rope.  \n# \n\ud83c\udfaf **Workout programs for every goal**  \n\u2705 High-intensity calorie burning  \n\u2705 Muscle building & endurance training  \n\u2705 Challenges & achievements to keep you motivated  \n#\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Fitness in the rhythm of your music**  \n\ud83d\udd39 Integrated with **Spotify** \u2013 train with your favorite tracks!  \n#\n\ud83d\udd25 **Unique features**  \n\ud83d\udd39 Monitor **calories burned, jump count, and progress** in real time!.  \n\ud83d\udd39 **Spotify** integration.  \n\ud83d\udd39 Music library.  \n\ud83d\udd39 XR mode or Virtual Environments.  \n\ud83d\udd39 **Real workout** programs created by fitness coach.", "short_description": "Next-Level fitness application! \ud83d\ude80\nJump with a virtual jump rope and get a real workout effect without space limitations! \ud83d\udcaa\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Programs for weight loss & muscle training\n\ud83c\udfb6 Spotify integration for extra motivation\n\ud83d\udcca Real-time performance tracking"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://jump-rope.app/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CODNES", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://jump-rope.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_